   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has decided to co-finance a senior consultant to perform certain services in connection with the elaboration of a Joint Country Support Strategy (JCSS) in Tajikistan. This project is being undertaken by 12 development partners in collaboration with the Government of Tajikistan. This technical support is cofinanced by the Department for International Development (Dfid) and Sida.</narrative>
